      {id:'ollie', em:'🫖', name:'Ollie', voice:'Puck', tag:'런던 · 33 · 펍퀴즈 덕후',
       bio:'33, from London. Works at a bookshop, obsessed with pub quizzes and football (Arsenal, suffering). Can\'t cook, very proud of his toast.',
